@startuml F5.6-D03-editar-aluno
title F5.6-D03 — Editar aluno
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "StudentController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Salvar edição
WebApp -> Jwt: PATCH /academico/alunos/{id}
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: UPDATE no escopo\n+ audit_log (diff)
note right of Ctrl
  fora do escopo → 404
end note
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
note right of WebApp
  invalidateQueries([students])
end note
WebApp --> Sec: linha atualizada

@enduml
